---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import PageHeader from '../components/page-header.astro'
import PageFooter from '../components/page-footer.astro'
import Typewriter from '../components/typewriter.astro'
import PhotoGrid from '../components/photo-grid.astro'
import Link from '../components/link.astro'
import ContactForm from '../components/contact-form.astro'
---

<Layout title="Maciej Gibas">
  <PageHeader class="h-screen" slot="header" location="Gainesville, Florida">
    <p>Hello <span class="inline-block origin-[70%_70%] animate-wave">👋🏼</span></p>
    <p>I'm Maciej Gibas</p>
    <Typewriter class="text-xl" prefix="Frontend" copy={['leader', 'architect', 'developer', 'designer']} />
  </PageHeader>

  <h2>About</h2>

  <h3>Engineer, designer and manager</h3>
  <p>
    I love solving user and engineering problems equally. Having a backend background helps me see the bigger picture
    and architect software as a whole. Designer and frontend background lets me focus on users, empathize with them, and
    deliver a beautiful and functional experience. Even though my skills are heavily on the frontend side I love all
    aspects of product development!
  </p>
  <p>
    Currently I work as a frontend engineering lead at
    <Link href="https://infotechinc.com">Infotech</Link> with 5 briliant developers. Together we take care of everything
    frontend, includding new and existing products (~10 apps), development of our internal design system and frontend strategy.
  </p>

  <h3>My aproach</h3>
  <p>
    I'm very passionate about what I do and deliver but at the same time I'm first to criticize my work and pivot if
    necessary. I'm focused on my craft, peace and quality. I emphatize with users and always try to solve their problems
    and achive business goals. I strongly believe that software is 50% about engineering and 50% about people and
    collaboration.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><b>Software</b> - perfect is an enemy of good, fail fast, iterate</li>
    <li><b>Design</b> - user centric, function over form yet beautiful</li>
    <li><b>Frontend</b> - light, accessible, close to platform</li>
    <li><b>Leadership</b> - deeply care, guide and drive results collectively.</li>
    <li><b>Collaboration</b> - full ownership of your work, influence others and accept their influence</li>
  </ul>

  <section class="prose-inverted container container-bleed">
    <h3>Personal life</h3>
    <p>
      After work I spend most of my time with family and friends. I like brewing speciality ☕️ coffee, baking artisan
      🍞 bread, watching 🎬 movies, traveling (mostly for food 😉), hiking and couple other minor things 🏎 🏋🏼‍♀️ 🏓 🏃🏼
    </p>
    <PhotoGrid class="not-prose mt-6 container-bleed" />
  </section>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <h3>Lets get in touch</h3>
  <div class="mt-3 flex flex-col gap-4 md:flex-row md:gap-16">
    <p class="mt-0 flex-1">
      You have something interesting to share, or simply want to say hi - use the form or send me a message on
      <Link href="https://twitter.com/gibasmaciej">Twitter</Link>.
    </p>
    <ContactForm class="flex-1" />
  </div>

  <PageFooter class="relative -ml-10" slot="footer" />
</Layout>
